  "name": "Marketing wallpaper screenshots",
  "description": "Marketing wallpaper screenshots in Mock Mode; captures only, no payments or publishing.",
  "details": "WALLPAPER SELECTION: Colors navy/sunset/beige then Artemis II in-eclipse, edge-of-lunar-day, setting-earth, new-moon, looking-back-at-earth. The screenshot schema requires canonical page names: the eight wallet occurrences map in that order to wallet-<themeName> in press/artwork/source/screenshots.json. Image captures wait for Wallpaper image loaded for <themeName>; palette captures wait for none. No persistence or app-state injection. Both platforms: --evidence screenshots --no-record. Capture only; no payments or publishing. Artemis: sat keeps the album default (in-eclipse) and is captured first; usd, eur and gbp get edge-of-lunar-day, setting-earth and new-moon through the unit background picker (each differs from that unit's album default so Apply appears; the first row of the picker is never picked because the tabs bar occludes its tap targets), then the wallet is captured per currency via the unit switcher. looking-back-at-earth sits in that first row, so it is reached by re-applying the Artemis album from the gallery (which assigns it to eur by position) and switching to EUR.",
  "lane": "simulator",
  "tags": ["flow:wallet","check:navigation"],
  "requires": ["fresh-install"],
